{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Liminal Nightmare is a short first-person horror experience where you wander through a surreal labyrinth shrouded in the dark, in the search of ancient masks while being hunted down by an evil presence; Explore, survive, and face a creature that plays with your fear when the lights are out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the labyrinth of your own nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There once was a saying in the great myths of old; Of a creature veiled in darkness that your dreams can take ahold. When darkness falls and crickets sing, lights are off and people sleep, with a swift and silent motion it places up on the skin, turning dreams to nightmares for him to enjoy, taking a bite every night until one is no more. He likes to play games, they'd also said, but for one to bear its curse leaves no witness to assure.&quot;</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005510/4a4bd62d35c9e0381990d6f46fbe8ca733591b0b.jpg"},{"name":"I had a weird dream last night...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005510/275a84f2db2b4be3a123fbbd94e3c792b86d05f5.jpg"},{"name":"Where the lights go?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005510/fa8a97dfa01bd8127a5f848c03686754d49c1db8.jpg"},{"name":"Im not afraid of the dark, but those walls...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005510/df45d366ae14968cfde34ee631ebdaad67b12d8d.jpg"},{"name":"The silence is deafening...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005510/9cd67d4d19ea5f17d46fd0a88b46b66c96938f30.jpg"},{"name":"True survivor!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005510/2bac90ab3d32c25eba29733a47bb359a116fd619.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://s